########## O6 firewall (ufw) — allow ONLY the Pi ##########
Prereq (Ubuntu): Ollama must listen on the LAN interface, not just 127.0.0.1 —
  you've already exposed it (ai.siggy-lab.org works), so this is satisfied; on a rebuild set OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0.
Run these, replacing <PI_LAN_IP> with the Pi's LAN IP:
  sudo ufw allow from <PI_LAN_IP> to any port 11434 proto tcp
  sudo ufw deny 11434
  sudo ufw status verbose
Then test from the Pi:       curl -sS -m 5 http://ai.siggy-lab.org:11434/api/tags   (should succeed)
Then test from ANOTHER host: curl -sS -m 5 http://ai.siggy-lab.org:11434/api/tags   (should time out/fail)

